actly once.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Missing to invoke it (eventually) will cause the calling task to remain suspended"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indefinitely which will result in the task “hanging” as well as being leaked with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no possibility to destroy it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike the “checked” continuation variant, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"UnsafeContinuation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"detect or diagnose any kind of misuse, so you need to be extra careful to avoid","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"calling ","type":"text"},{"code":"resume","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" twice or forgetting to call resume before letting go of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"continuation object.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","name":"See Also","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withUnsafeThrowingContinuation(function:_:)"}]}]},{"type":"aside","name":"See Also","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withCheckedContinuation(function:_:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"See Also","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withCheckedThrowingContinuation(function:_:)"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/withCheckedThrowingContinuation(function:_:)-2k46m":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/withCheckedThrowingContinuation(function:_:)-2k46m","title":"withCheckedThrowingContinuation(function:_:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/withcheckedthrowi